---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Programs — Verde Health">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-700">Programs</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">
      A snapshot of initiatives we’re building with partners and communities.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-700">Community Screening Days</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">
          Regular pop-up events for vitals, diabetes/hypertension checks, and referrals.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Mobile teams with basic diagnostics</li>
          <li>Referral slips to nearby clinics</li>
          <li>Education on lifestyle & follow-up</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-700">Imaging Access Pilot</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">
          Hub-and-spoke model to connect clinics to affordable ultrasound & X-ray.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Central hub + trained operators</li>
          <li>Tele-radiology for reads</li>
          <li>Subsidized pricing</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-700">Essential Medicines Supply</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">
          Partnerships to improve availability of quality generics and last-mile delivery.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-700">Health Education & Training</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">
          Patient education, nurse upskilling, and community health worker toolkits.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
